exports[`setup transcript (runSetup on a recording fake runner) analyze, disable-sudo: true, sudo-config: warnings 1`] = `
[
  "warning: sudo-config: '/usr/bin/apt-get update' gives the job root (apt-get can run or write anything), so sudo can remove the egress controls",
  "warning: sudo-config: '/usr/bin/apt-get install *' gives the job root (apt-get can run or write anything), so sudo can remove the egress controls",
  "warning: disable-sudo: true is not applied in analyze mode: analyze never changes sudo. The summary lists the sudo commands enforce would block. Use mode: enforce to remove sudo.",
]
`;

